sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Django
    participant FastAPI
    participant YOLO as YOLO Engine
    participant Storage as Shared Storage
    participant ClearML
    
    User->>Django: POST /training<br/>(dataset_id, hyperparams)
    Django->>FastAPI: HTTP Request
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Queue training job
    FastAPI-->>Django: Accept (status=QUEUED)
    Django-->>User: Job ID
    
    Note over FastAPI,YOLO: For each seed (3-5 runs)
    FastAPI->>YOLO: Start training<br/>(seed=42)
    YOLO->>YOLO: Initialize model
    YOLO->>YOLO: Epoch 1-50 loop
    YOLO->>YOLO: Collect metrics
    YOLO->>YOLO: Validate
    YOLO->>Storage: Save checkpoint
    ClearML->>ClearML: Log per-epoch metrics
    YOLO->>YOLO: Clean CUDA memory
    
    YOLO-->>FastAPI: Training complete<br/>(metrics={seed:42, mAP50:0.85})
    
    Note over FastAPI: Aggregate metrics across seeds
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Select best model<br/>(highest mAP50)
    FastAPI->>Storage: Save best model
    FastAPI->>Storage: Write best_model_ref.json
    
    FastAPI->>ClearML: Log final metrics
    FastAPI->>ClearML: Register best model
    
    FastAPI-->>Django: COMPLETED<br/>(model_path, metrics)
    Django-->>User: Training finished<br/>Model ready for deployment
